00:06:26.099 --> 00:06:28.972
- We start trying different
things and you try different

00:06:28.972 --> 00:06:31.503
cords or different structures of songs,

00:06:31.503 --> 00:06:34.089
different beats that you've
never really explored that

00:06:34.089 --> 00:06:35.089
path before.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:40.747
You know, and I think having
always been a writer first,

00:06:41.996 --> 00:06:45.794
I'm obsessed with the
syncopation of the way that words

00:06:45.794 --> 00:06:47.766
sound when they're said a certain way.

00:06:47.766 --> 00:06:50.886
And once I've kind of done
something once I always

00:06:50.886 --> 00:06:53.760
want to kind of go to a
different direction and never

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:54.685
repeat myself.

00:06:54.685 --> 00:06:58.586
So as a writer I think
that I've always hoped that

00:06:58.586 --> 00:07:03.156
my music would constantly
be changing because you

00:07:03.156 --> 00:07:05.158
never want to make the same album twice,

00:07:05.158 --> 00:07:09.325
the same song twice and my
greatest hope has been that

00:07:10.309 --> 00:07:14.476
as I grow my fans will grow
up with me and as I change

00:07:15.377 --> 00:07:18.039
and my life changes, my
music will change as well.

00:07:18.039 --> 00:07:20.619
So wish me luck there.

00:07:20.619 --> 00:07:24.039
- Team Minaj says, "I
love you, but I'm curious,

00:07:24.039 --> 00:07:25.414
"why did you change your
rapping style from the come up

00:07:25.414 --> 00:07:28.573
"days to today? I love both."

00:07:28.573 --> 00:07:31.823
- I don't think I changed my rap style.

00:07:33.196 --> 00:07:35.492
I think you guys were
just starting to hear me,

00:07:35.492 --> 00:07:37.637
and you didn't hear all of my yet.

00:07:37.637 --> 00:07:41.054
I've always been into weird a little bit.

00:07:42.745 --> 00:07:45.499
But I think what people
really mean is that they

00:07:45.499 --> 00:07:48.141
think that I've changed my persona.

00:07:48.141 --> 00:07:52.308
And life is about growth
and change and I don't want

00:07:53.972 --> 00:07:56.552
to remain the same for my whole life.

00:07:56.552 --> 00:08:00.719
I want to be able to change
and I respect the people who

00:08:03.284 --> 00:08:07.065
loved, you know, '07 Nicki
and definitely going to

00:08:07.065 --> 00:08:10.284
give you some stuff on Pink Friday.

00:08:10.284 --> 00:08:13.302
Like, I'm not forgetting
anybody, but I also have to be

00:08:13.302 --> 00:08:15.050
true to me.

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:19.064
And the truth is, I started
seeing different things,

00:08:19.064 --> 00:08:21.197
I started going different
places, I started eating

00:08:21.197 --> 00:08:22.030
different things.

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:26.197
I can't, it would be
fraudulent to rap the same way

00:08:27.435 --> 00:08:29.556
and look the same way and
act the same way because

00:08:29.556 --> 00:08:31.945
I am not the same, period.

00:08:31.945 --> 00:08:33.063
I don't know how to--

00:08:33.063 --> 00:08:35.144
- Well everyone has their
different belief systems.

00:08:35.144 --> 00:08:38.955
I think everyone has their
different opinions of

00:08:38.955 --> 00:08:40.682
those types of things
that you talked about.

00:08:40.682 --> 00:08:42.916
Certainly, as an athlete,
I care very much what I put

00:08:42.916 --> 00:08:43.871
into my body.

00:08:43.871 --> 00:08:47.516
I think that, I'm 38 years
old, I'm not 22 anymore.

00:08:47.516 --> 00:08:49.418
- You look good.

00:08:49.418 --> 00:08:51.775
- You're very sweet, thank
you, but all those things

00:08:51.775 --> 00:08:52.608
are important.

00:08:52.608 --> 00:08:54.436
And all the little things
add up to be big things.

00:08:54.436 --> 00:08:56.712
So when I'm trying to
accomplish things professionally

00:08:56.712 --> 00:09:00.064
that in a lot of ways I'm
in uncharted territory

00:09:00.064 --> 00:09:02.523
so I've got to do things
differently and I've got to

00:09:02.523 --> 00:09:03.884
evolve over time.

00:09:03.884 --> 00:09:06.824
I've got things that may
have worked in the past

00:09:06.824 --> 00:09:07.907
maybe don't work as you move forward.

00:09:07.907 --> 00:09:09.532
So the lessons that I've
learned through my own

00:09:09.532 --> 00:09:11.794
trial and error, I think I'm
at that point in my career

00:09:11.794 --> 00:09:13.361
