with what I'm doing.

00:09:13.361 --> 00:09:15.633
So I try to eat healthy, I
try to get the right amount

00:09:15.633 --> 00:09:17.963
of rest, I try to do the
right types of exercise

00:09:17.963 --> 00:09:20.037
so I can be on the field and
be available for my team.

00:09:20.037 --> 00:09:23.044
I try to be as productive
this time in my career

00:09:23.044 --> 00:09:24.544
as I was earlier.

